WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:03.480
SCP-096 Vs SCP-3008.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:08.750
096 may be able to tear almost anything apart,
but does it have the mental strength to put

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.430
together an Ikea shelving unit without going
insane?

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:14.480
This is the Shy Guy Vs The Infinite Ikea.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.910
This flat pack labyrinth has trapped and claimed
many a soul.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:22.660
The maze-like inner structure is only made
more hazardous with the inclusion of The Staff,

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.160
an army of faceless humanoid creatures eager
to kill anyone left inside after dark.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:32.759
However, not only does SCP-096 not need food
to survive, it’s unlikely the staff would

00:00:32.759 --> 00:00:37.609
do any meaningful damage to it, and it would
probably rather enjoy being trapped in a giant

00:00:37.609 --> 00:00:40.600
warehouse with fewer people to see its face.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.050
But if someone looked at a photo of it on
the outside, the psychic link would allow

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:52.489
it to intuitively know which direction to
run in, and escape the Infinite Ikea immediately.

